  "description": "Former rising star, current no-name actor Jang Seung-Min’s lucked out. Not only has he nabbed a role in a TV show, but he’s also getting to work with the biggest star in the country, Ha Hyeon-Je. Charismatic, handsome, but also a little bit of a jerk, Hyeon-Je has a magnetic presence that draws everyone in. Before Seung-Min knows it, he’s become yet another Ha Hyeon-Je fanboy. Seung-Min's satisfied with keeping a safe distance between himself and Hyeon-Je, but... Why is Hyeon-Je so interested in Seung-Min? More importantly, what does \"the incident\" that happened 7 years ago have to do with anything? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Notes: Includes five extra chapters.*",
